Justification
-------------
Available:
The artifact is publicly archived on Zenodo (or Figshare) with a permanent DOI. It contains all
materials needed to reproduce the results, including the source code, documentation, and a
pre-built Docker image.

Functional:
We provide a pre-built Docker image that loads and runs successfully. Inside the container, the C
implementations under template-implementations build and run, and the Rocq development under
template-proofs can be checked by compilation using `make`.

Reusable:
The artifact is organized and documented with clear instructions. It provides modular
implementations and proofs for multiple concurrent search structure templates, enabling other
researchers to reuse and extend the codebase (e.g., by adding new data structures or new template
instances) with minimal setup.
